  "description": "Pure-managed JPEG XR (ITU-T T.832 / ISO/IEC 29199-2) encoder/decoder for .NET. AOT-compatible, clean-room implementation from the T.832 specification. Supports BD8/BD16/BD16F/BD32F sample formats, grayscale and RGB, multi-tile codestreams with INDEX_TABLE_TILES (including random-access tile decode), spatial and frequency mode, Photo Overlap Transform (POT), lossy quantization, alpha plane, and full .jxr file container.",
